{"path":"container/forward_list/erase_after","title":"std::forward_list<T,Allocator>::erase_after","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::forward_list&lt;T,Allocator&gt;::</span>erase_after","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/container/forward_list/erase_after","section":"container","kind":"page","summary":"Removes specified elements from the container.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx11\" id=\"Version_1\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">iterator erase_after<span class=\"br0\">(</span> const_iterator pos <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (1) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(since C++11)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx11\" id=\"Version_2\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">iterator erase_after<span class=\"br0\">(</span> const_iterator first, const_iterator last <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (2) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(since C++11)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Removes specified elements from the container.\n</p>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">1)</span> Removes the element following <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">pos</span></code>.</div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">2)</span> Removes the elements following <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">first</span></code> until <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">last</span></code>.</div>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> pos\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> iterator to the element preceding the element to remove\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> first, last\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> range of elements to remove\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">1)</span> Iterator to the element following the erased one, or <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/container/forward_list/end\">end()</a></span> if no such element exists.</div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">2)</span> <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">last</span></code></div>\n<h3 id=\"Complexity\">Complexity</h3>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">1)</span> Constant.</div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">2)</span> Linear in distance between <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">first</span></code> and <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">last</span></code>.</div>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;forward_list&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iterator&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/container/forward_list\"><span class=\"kw1281\">std::<span class=\"me2\">forward_list</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">int</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> l <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"nu0\">1</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">2</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">3</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">4</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">5</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">6</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">7</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">8</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">9</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"co1\">//  l.erase(l.begin()); // Error: no function erase()</span>\n&nbsp;\n    l.<span class=\"me1\">erase_after</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>l.<span class=\"me1\">before_begin</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"co1\">// Removes first element</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <span class=\"kw1\">for</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">auto</span> n <span class=\"sy4\">:</span> l<span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n        <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> n <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">' '</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <span class=\"kw4\">auto</span> fi <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/iterator/next\"><span class=\"kw679\">std::<span class=\"me2\">next</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>l.<span class=\"me1\">begin</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"kw4\">auto</span> la <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/iterator/next\"><span class=\"kw679\">std::<span class=\"me2\">next</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>fi, <span class=\"nu0\">3</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    l.<span class=\"me1\">erase_after</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>fi, la<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <span class=\"kw1\">for</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">auto</span> n <span class=\"sy4\">:</span> l<span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n        <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> n <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">' '</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>2 3 4 5 6 7 8 9\n2 3 6 7 8 9</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/container/forward_list/clear\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>clear</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  clears the contents <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Complexity","id":"Complexity"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"container","title":"Containers library"},{"path":"container/forward_list","title":"std::forward_list"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::forward_list<T,Allocator>::erase_after","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"2 declarations; revisions: since C++11. Removes specified elements from the container."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"pos, first, last"},{"label":"Return value","note":"Iterator to the element following the erased one, or end() if no such element exists."},{"label":"Complexity","note":"Constant."},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"clear","note":"clears the contents"}]}]},"standards":["C++11"],"wordCount":187,"codeBlockCount":2}
